                                Each category outlines a key area of responsibility expected from all Risebird interviewers. Please review these expectations carefully, as they directly impact your eligibility for interviews, continued access to the platform, and payment processing.
                                <h5 style="margin-top:10px;font-size:21px;">Category 1 : Professional Conduct, Communication, Technical Readiness, Ethics, and Time Discipline</h5>
