                                    <li>Ensure interviews are neither artificially shortened nor unnecessarily extended.</li>
                                    <li>Communicate clearly, professionally, and fluently in English.</li>
                                    <li>Clearly articulate interview questions and instructions to avoid confusion.</li>
                                    <li>Respond promptly and effectively to communications from Risebird and clients.</li>
                                    <li>Always maintain professionalism, fairness, and impartiality during interviews.</li>
                                    <li>Dress in professional attire when webcam usage is required.</li>
                                    <li>Maintain courteous and respectful communication at all times.</li>
                                    <li>Do not engage in aggressive, disparaging, disrespectful, or inappropriate interactions.</li>
                                    <li>Avoid consumption of alcohol, drugs, or other substances before or during interviews.</li>
                                    <li>Ensure robust and reliable infrastructure, including stable internet and quality audio/video equipment.</li>
                                    <li>Address technical issues proactively and swiftly to minimize disruptions.</li>
